        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART I, LINE 4B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE CREDIT UNION HAS A 457(B) NON-QUALIFIED DEFERRED COMPENSATION PLAN FOR CERTAIN MEMBERS OF MANAGEMENT. THE CREDIT UNION DOES NOT CONTRIBUTE TO THIS PLAN. THE DEFERRED COMPENSATION AMOUNTS ARE SHOWN AS BOTH ASSETS AND LIABILITIES IN THE CREDIT UNION'S STATEMENTS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION AND ARE AVAILABLE TO CREDITORS IN THE EVENT OF THE CREDIT UNION'S LIQUIDATION. BALANCES ARE HELD IN VARIOUS INVESTMENT SECURITIES. THE BALANCE OF THE DEFERRED COMPENSATION UNDER THIS PLAN IS CLASSIFIED WITHIN OTHER ASSETS AND ACCRUED EXPENSES AND OTHER LIABILITIES AND WAS $292,938 AND $267,517 AS OF SEPTEMBER 30, 2024 AND 2023, RESPECTIVELY.</ExplanationTxt>
